content:
Two part numbers in the ordering table differ only by temperature grade; optical and rate specs are shared. Bit-rate and wavelength pairs from the pool that belong to one operating range (min/typ/max data rate; Tx vs Rx wavelength rows) are not separate selectable modes.

```json
{
  "modes": [
    {
      "label": "LS-SM316G-02C 6.144G 1310nm 0 to +70°C",
      "model": "LS-SM316G-02C",
      "wavelength_min_nm": 1270.0,
      "wavelength_max_nm": 1350.0,
      "bit_rate_gbps": 6.144
    },
    {
      "label": "LS-SM316G-02I 6.144G 1310nm -40 to +85°C",
      "model": "LS-SM316G-02I",
      "wavelength_min_nm": 1270.0,
      "wavelength_max_nm": 1350.0,
      "bit_rate_gbps": 6.144
    }
  ]
}
```
